exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=astronomy: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "The principals are the captured rogue world and Tau Reticuli Cohort; the measurable damage accumulates at Custos Echo-58 Belt VI. The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: the safety margins were drawn before Captured rogue world started moving. Longshore crews demand danger pay in scrip that clears the same day. The boundary condition nobody can renegotiate: every mitigation contract written against Refugee ark parking orbit has lapsed or failed. The principals are the refugee ark parking orbit and Custos Echo-58 Belt VI; the measurable damage accumulates at Custos Echo-58 Belt IV. Any honest error analysis ends at the same unmodeled input: every survey pass returns numbers that contradict the pass before it. Every model of the dispute shares one input: evacuation drills have gone from annual to weekly without an announcement. Three bodies define this problem: the captured rogue world, Custos Echo-58 Belt IV, and Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter, which absorbs the perturbations. The residual no published account explains: corporate records were altered. Seismic and thermal baselines for Custos Echo-58 Belt IV are extrapolated from Custos Echo-58 Belt IV Charter's single-point coverage.",
  "spineEdgeType": "DESTABILIZES",
  "spineSummary": "Captured rogue world took shape in the third pulse cycle, the perturbation from the captured rogue world now exceeds Tau Reticuli Cohort's tolerance margin.",
}
`;

exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=balanced: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "Red Vane Labor Combine presses, Veyra-Locke Concession holds, and Helion Debt Synod pays for both: wages frozen until someone blinks. The shooting part is over; the settling of who owes whom for it may outlast the survivors. The dispute has a second floor: the arbitration clock runs out at the end of the quarter, then the guns decide. Children play a game with the old checkpoint hand-signals; their parents make them stop. The pressure underneath is simple: the arbitration that used to settle this dissolved with its sponsor. Helion Debt Synod wants control of the schedule everyone else plans around; Ninth Ledger Office guards the last berth they can still afford to hold; Red Vane Labor Combine gets family on both sides of the picket line. Veterans of the dispute drink in the same hall, at tables an aisle apart. Neither Kestrel Free Compact nor Veyra-Locke Concession will blink first, and Red Vane Labor Combine absorbs the difference — wages frozen until someone blinks. The dispute has a second floor: Kestrel Free Compact turned on Veyra-Locke Concession after the first audit. Cargo manifests between the two camps now travel with notarized seals nobody used to bother with.",
  "spineEdgeType": "CONTESTS",
  "spineSummary": "Everything else in this system is priced against the quarrel between Red Vane Labor Combine and Veyra-Locke Concession.",
}
`;

exports[`spine tone × edge type voice matrix > tone=cinematic: spine prose reads in tone voice 1`] = `
{
  "body0": "Two names on every manifest and every curse: Brothers of Choir, Long Knife Choir. Underneath the flags and the filings, the truth is a blade: every neutral broker who touched this dispute has since recused or vanished. The joint maintenance schedule still runs, but each side sends its own inspector to watch the other's. The war is on, whatever the bulletins call it. Carrion Synod circles Crown of Dust Pact the way debt circles a harvest. The public channel carries two incompatible traffic advisories for the same lane. Freight insurance for the contested run now costs more than the freight. The fight belongs to the resonance-pumped exocomet swarm and Calvera-10 V; the bleeding is done at Calvera-10 V Platform. It is loud now — escort guns, night transfers, and funerals with honor guards. At night the lights of Calvera-10 V Platform are the only argument that Calvera-10 V belongs to anyone.",
  "spineEdgeType": "CONTESTS",
  "spineSummary": "The compact between Brothers of Choir and Long Knife Choir broke in the silent decade, the two of them are bleeding each other dry, and the system cheers them on.",
}
